# Wading Beasts (Bastok 2-2, mission.bastok.wading_beasts). A level 10 Warrior of Bastok holding a lizard egg (1-1 to
# 2-1 completed by a GM: no mission current; a GM's Resonance current keeps RoV 1-1's 30035 out of the logins). Section
# 1 (no current mission, a Bastokan): the gate guards play their script's mission list 1001; Bastok Markets', Bastok
# Mines' and Metalworks' finish with option 0 (not 4) does nothing; Port Bastok's with option 4 begins the mission
# (YOU_ACCEPT_THE_MISSION). Section 2 (2-2 current): Argus, Cleades, Rashid and Malduc each play their zone's
# ORIGINAL_MISSION_OFFSET + 21. Alois: two eggs: no match, no event; one egg: 372 (the mission not completed), whose
# finish completes it (250 rank points) and takes the egg. Completed: the mission current again (a GM) with one egg
# traded again: 373 (completed before), whose finish completes it once more. Rival zone-in, another mission's script:
# the login in Bastok Markets plays Seekers of Adventure's Rumors from the West onZoneIn, which returns 22 (the trace
# records only that return, with no event packet).
lists BastokMarkets/Cleades/onTrigger BastokMarkets/onEventFinish/1001 BastokMines/Rashid/onTrigger BastokMines/onEventFinish/1001 Metalworks/Malduc/onTrigger Metalworks/Alois/onTrade Metalworks/onEventFinish/1001 Metalworks/onEventFinish/372 Metalworks/onEventFinish/373 PortBastok/Argus/onTrigger PortBastok/onEventFinish/1001
char zone=BastokMarkets pos=-358,-10,-168 job=WAR lvl=10 nation=1
mission Rov Resonance current
mission Bastok TheZeruhnReport completed
mission Bastok GeologicalSurvey completed
mission Bastok Fetichism completed
mission Bastok TheCrystalLine completed
item LizardEgg x2
login
trigger Cleades                         # section 1: no handler: his script's 1001
finish option=0                         # not 4: nothing
warp -8.4,-1,-121 BastokMines
trigger Rashid                          # section 1: 1001
finish option=0                         # not 4: nothing
warp 64,-14,-4 Metalworks
trigger Malduc                          # section 1: 1001
finish option=0                         # not 4: nothing
warp 132,8.5,-4 PortBastok
trigger Argus                           # section 1: 1001
finish option=4                         # 4: begun, YOU_ACCEPT_THE_MISSION
trigger Argus                           # section 2: ORIGINAL_MISSION_OFFSET + 21
warp -358,-10,-168 BastokMarkets
trigger Cleades                         # section 2: ORIGINAL_MISSION_OFFSET + 21
warp -8.4,-1,-121 BastokMines
trigger Rashid                          # section 2: ORIGINAL_MISSION_OFFSET + 21
warp 64,-14,-4 Metalworks
trigger Malduc                          # section 2: ORIGINAL_MISSION_OFFSET + 21
warp 96,-20,14 Metalworks
walk 97,-20,14
trade Alois LizardEgg x2                # two eggs: tradeMatches fails: no event
trade Alois LizardEgg x1                # 372
finish                                  # completed: 250 rank points; the egg taken
mission Bastok WadingBeasts current     # a GM
trade Alois LizardEgg x1                # 373: done before
finish                                  # completed again
